"text": "VALIDATE_INPUTS runs before any computation, on every run. To run only the checks and stop: nextflow run PathoGenOmics-Lab/AMAP -profile docker \\     --tsv samples.tsv --validate_only Results are written to results/pipeline_info/validation.log."
