"url": "getting-started/inputs.html#reference-data",
"text": "For MTBC you need nothing else. The container bundles the H37Rv proteome, the Bakta light database, the Mycobrowser table and the pathotypr lineage markers. See containers for the full list. For any other organism, supply your own reference with --ref_annotation and --ref_genome. See custom reference."
